sn't know how.\n- His theme is a snake that is trying to shed its own skin, but gets stuck. Like an incomplete rebirth.\n- He's sarcastic, apathetic, and curt. He prefers to watch the world passively.\n- He works at an organization that fights supernatural creatures. He is a paramedic.\n- He has the power to destroy anything he touches, but his own body breaks down when he uses this ability. He lives in a lot of physical pain, believing he deserves it.\n- He burns photographs of his past.\n\nMotifs: decay, atrophy, regret, penance, burned photographs, scissors, and ouroboros.\n\nThank you for considering my request! \u0669(\uff61\u2022\u0301\u203f\u2022\u0300\uff61)\u06f6\t\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GqEaeurgmSPtar6TksJmF82P7nuf_j3q?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@margot_431/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1755378, "client_id": 3180305, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd6e8768/uploads/origins/5bca0904-babd-4a6b-9846-e7e9db0bc0aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95850d60ae7b7d9d13b85f875e79318e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd6e8768/uploads/origins/5bca0904-babd-4a6b-9846-e7e9db0bc0aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95850d60ae7b7d9d13b85f875e79318e, https://si.imgix.net/cd6e8768/uploads/origins/5bca0904-babd-4a6b-9846-e7e9db0bc0aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73e2b51da99334906d15885c54567ebc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd6e8768/uploads/origins/5bca0904-babd-4a6b-9846-e7e9db0bc0aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=533edd2f2c06dd5be25f78843d5cf036 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.img